I can think of some cool stuff.  How about recording when you enter 
Minetown, when you find the Luckstone, when you get to the Oracle, when 
you complete Sokoban, when you enter the Castle, when you enter 
Gehennom, when you kill each of the named enemies (Juiblex, Vlad, 
Asmodeus, Orcus), when you first get the Amulet, when you #invoke on the 
Vibrating Square, when you escape the first level of the Dungeon, when 
you enter each Plane, and when you #offer.  I think that'd be neat.

I like the idea of including a text editor in the game.  It'd be great 
to be able to do #log and just type, with the simplest editting features 
available, into a little log to keep track of your character.  Obviously 
it would break save combatility (since you'd be writing the log into 
savefiles).  It would also add some fun to bonesfiles.  Put on the 
tombstone something relevant to the character's previous adventure, not 
just how they died, i.e.

